Package: libwnck-3-0
Version: @DEB_LIBWNCK3_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libwnck
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libcairo2, libx11-6, libxres1, libstartup-notification0
Description: Window Navigator Construction Kit (GTK3 library)
 libwnck provides access to the client window list and window-manager hints
 (EWMH) for pagers, task lists and window menus. Required by xfwm4 and used by
 xfce4-panel, xfce4-session and xfdesktop.
